# Record the README GIF with https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs
#   vhs docs/demo.tape
Output docs/demo.gif
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Type "claudepilot"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "what does git rebase --onto do?"
Enter
Sleep 8s
Type "Design the architecture for a plugin system with trade-offs"
Enter
Sleep 10s
